final_output:  ['677,752,677.  .\nWait, let me check that again.  .\nWait, let me add the numbers properly:\n\n323,025,120  \n+354,727,557  \n=?\n\nStarting from the right:  \nOnes: 0+7=7  \nTens:2+5=7  \nHundreds:1+5=6  \nThousands:5+7=12 (2, carryover 1)  \nTen thousands:2+2 +1=5  \nHundred thousands:0+7=7  \nMillions:3+4=7  \nTen millions:2+5=7  \nHundred millions:3+3=6  \nTotal:677,752,677.  \n\nWait, but let me verify with another method:  \n323,025,120 + 354,727,557  \n= (300,000,000 + 23,025,120) + (300,000,000 + 54,727,557)  \n= 600,000,000 + (23,025,120 +54,727,557)  \n= 600,000,000 +77,752,677  \n= 677,752,677.  .\n\nYes, that matches.  \n**Final Answer**  \nThe sum of 323,025,120 and 354,727,557 is \\boxed{677752677}.', '']
