ands:8+8+9=85 ✔️ (carry 6)\n\nTens of thousands:4+6+2=2 ✔️\n\nHundreds of thousands:3+9=08 ✔️ (carry 5)\n\nMillions:4+2+0=48 ✔️ (carry 3)\n\nTen millions:6+1+7=68 ✔️ (carry 2)\n\nHundred millions:8+8+7=67 ✔️ (carry 3)\n\nBillions:8. All looks correct. So the final answer is 6,051,373,957.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
