rect. Let me just do a rough estimate to check if it's in the ballpark.\n\nFirst number is about 498 million, second is about 453 million. Adding them gives roughly 5,866 million, which is 6.164 billion. The exact answer is 7,802,091,976, so that makes sense. The approximate matches the exact, so I feel confident.\n</think>. Therefore, the answer is"]]
