ial thinking. Let's confirm with another method:\n\n967,522,983 + 374,001,649.\n\nAdding step by step:\n\n967,522,983 + 300,000,000 = 1,267,522,983\n\nAdding 74,001,649:\n\n1,267,522,983 + 70,000,000 = 1,337,522,983\n\nThen +4,001,649:\n\n1,337,522,983 +4,000,000 = 1,341,522,983\n\nThen +1,649:\n\n1,341,522,983 +1,649 = 1,341,524,632.\n\nYes, that matches. So the correct answer is 1,341,524,632. I must have confused numbers in my initial thought process, but after careful step-by-step addition, it's clear.", '']
