8  \n= (174,641,570 + 200,000,000) = 374,641,570  \n+79,819,878 \u2192 374,641,570 +70,000,000 =444,641,570  \n+9,819,878 \u2192 total 454,461,448. So that matches. Therefore the correct answer is 454,461,448.\n\nBut the initial reasoning had a mistake in step 8. The ten millions place digits are 7 +7=14 plus the carryover 1 makes 15. So the digit there is 5, carryover1 to hundred millions. Thus the final answer is correct.\n\n**Final Answer**  \nThe final computed sum is \\boxed{454461448}.",
